Welcome to LuminOS Glass (pre-alpha)

  Flavor: Glass (Hyprland, lean package set)
  Base:   CachyOS / Arch (linux-cachyos)

  Desktop tips (VirtualBox):
    - Click "LuminOS" on the top bar for the app menu
    - Or Alt+D (menu) / Alt+Return (terminal)
    - Win/Super key usually does NOT work in VirtualBox
    - Login if prompted: lumin / lumin

  Try: lumin-fetch
       lumin-mgr --status

  Docs: https://github.com/nosleepzzz/luminos
